      "ArticleTitle": "Long-term follow-up on the treatment of endometriosis with the GnRH-agonist buserelinacetate. Long-term follow-up data (up to 98 months) of 42 patients with endometriosis who were treated with GnRH-agonist buserelinacetate (Suprecur), were evaluated in respect of recurrence of pain symptoms and pregnancy outcome.",
